function submitPublicCase(payload){try{ensureInitialized_();var p=sanitizePublicCase_(payload||{});validateCaseInput_(p);var attachments=validateAttachments_(p.attachments);var caseId=generateCaseId_(),tracking=generateTrackingCode_(),rule=getLegalRule_(p.category,p.priority),deadline=rule&&rule.deadlineDays?new Date(Date.now()+Number(rule.deadlineDays)*86400000):'';var folder=createCaseFolder_(caseId);var c={caseId:caseId,publicTrackingCode:tracking,createdAt:now_(),updatedAt:now_(),category:p.category,priority:p.priority,status:STATUSES.NEW,incidentDate:p.incidentDate,incidentLocation:p.incidentLocation,village:p.village,description:p.description,relatedPersons:p.relatedPersons,latitude:p.latitude,longitude:p.longitude,anonymous:p.anonymous,reporterName:p.reporterName,reporterPhone:p.reporterPhone,reporterEmail:p.reporterEmail,contactConsent:p.contactConsent,assignedTo:'',assignedAt:'',deadline:deadline,closedAt:'',resolution:'',source:'WEB',attachmentFolderId:folder.getId()};var lock=LockService.getScriptLock();lock.waitLock(10000);try{appendRow_(SHEETS.CASES,CASE_FIELDS,c);}finally{lock.releaseLock();}if(attachments.length){saveAttachments_(caseId,folder,attachments,'PUBLIC');}appendHistory_(caseId,'CREATE',STATUSES.NEW,STATUSES.NEW,'PUBLIC','Tiếp nhận thông tin mới','');audit_('PUBLIC','CREATE_CASE','CASE',caseId,'PUBLIC',{});notifyNewCase_(c);return ok_({caseId:caseId,publicTrackingCode:tracking,createdAt:formatDate_(c.createdAt),status:PUBLIC_STATUS_LABELS.NEW},'Thông tin của bạn đã được tiếp nhận.');}catch(e){return errorResponse_(e);}}
function trackPublicCase(payload){try{ensureInitialized_();var id=safeText_(payload.caseId,50),code=safeText_(payload.publicTrackingCode,50);var c=findRowById_(SHEETS.CASES,'caseId',id,CASE_FIELDS);if(!c||c.publicTrackingCode!==code)return fail_('NOT_FOUND','Không tìm thấy hồ sơ hoặc mã tra cứu không đúng.');return ok_({caseId:c.caseId,createdAt:formatDate_(c.createdAt),category:getCategoryLabel_(c.category),priority:getPriorityLabel_(c.priority),status:c.status,statusLabel:PUBLIC_STATUS_LABELS[c.status]||c.status,updatedAt:formatDate_(c.updatedAt),deadline:c.deadline?formatDate_(c.deadline):null},'Tra cứu thành công.');}catch(e){return errorResponse_(e);}}
function getCategoryLabel_(v){var x=CATEGORIES.filter(function(c){return c.value===v;})[0];return x?x.label:v;}
function getPriorityLabel_(v){var x=PRIORITIES.filter(function(c){return c.value===v;})[0];return x?x.label:v;}
